[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1210.549, "timestamp": "00:20:10", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1216.07, "timestamp": "00:20:16", "text": "等等，我的麦克风是不是漏音了？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1225.669, "timestamp": "00:20:25", "text": "声音是不是太大了？声音是不是太大了？好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1228.71, "timestamp": "00:20:28", "text": "好的。不，你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1231.43, "timestamp": "00:20:31", "text": "我喜欢通过聊天，因为它有两种类型"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1233.909, "timestamp": "00:20:33", "text": "人。两个倒置的内向汽水"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1236.23, "timestamp": "00:20:36", "text": "或者只是些语无伦次、喋喋不休的人。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1238.95, "timestamp": "00:20:38", "text": "我们确实看到了很多这样的情况。我本人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1241.51, "timestamp": "00:20:41", "text": "进入"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1242.909, "timestamp": "00:20:42", "text": "我不知道该怎么做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1245.43, "timestamp": "00:20:45", "text": "翻译但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1247.909, "timestamp": "00:20:47", "text": "这件事对他们产生了影响。哦，是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1250.63, "timestamp": "00:20:50", "text": "是啊是啊。我知道，伙计。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1252.95, "timestamp": "00:20:52", "text": "不，不，不，等等。你在音频中听到的内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1254.71, "timestamp": "00:20:54", "text": "是直播吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1257.19, "timestamp": "00:20:57", "text": "完全相同的噪声抑制"}]